Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:19.12,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(355.9,83)}JUNGLE EMPEROR
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} On the African continent, there is{\i}\N{\i1}a valley that runs north to south.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is called the Great Rift Valley.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Although called a valley, its vastness{\i}\N{\i1}is as though the earth was ripped open.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the west of the valley{\i}\N{\i1}are the jungle of Congo,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to the east are the savannas{\i}\N{\i1}of Uganda and Kenya,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to the north is the Nile River{\i}\N{\i1}that runs from Lake Victoria{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and also the Sahara desert.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For a long time,{\i}\N{\i1}the rugged nature of these lands{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}prevented Africa{\i}\N{\i1}from having civilized culture{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and so it had been called{\i}\N{\i1}the Dark Continent.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's different now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Day has dawned in Africa.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the 20th century,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Africa is embarking on a journey towards{\i}\N{\i1}building a bright new civilized culture.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, if you leave{\i}\N{\i1}the bright world of humankind{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and take one step into the jungle…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it is still the Dark Continent.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are the law of the jungle,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where the strong survive{\i}\N{\i1}and the weak are annihilated,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and death.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This story begins in an animal kingdom{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}located in the jungle near the equator.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja's queen is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Her Majesty Queen Eliza is on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She was captured by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And, also
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the poor queen is about to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all support her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for agreeing right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an all-white, cute little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A little over a month has now passed.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the animals were sold off{\i}\N{\i1}at various ports,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but, Panja's queen Eliza{\i}\N{\i1}was still on board the ship.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's this girl's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A lion's cub is no longer a baby\Nwhen they've grown to about your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So today, I'm going to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the story of your father, Panja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja was a very smart and brave lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father Panja
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,always protected all the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,from the humans\Nwho came to vandalize the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The white lion hasn't shown up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be intimidated by the sight of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking. He's somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me the rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our animals are escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Drat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Father was so strong, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only was he strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,he was also very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is why
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,so many weak little animals\Nliked to gather around Panja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What? We're going to have a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations,\NQueen Eliza and King Panja!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone get eaten again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. A lone monkey was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the panther as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've punished him before.\NThis is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all the same, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They all go insane when they get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here for the remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mandy, where's Panja?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he go to the humans' village again\Nto get livestock?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, probably…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's putting himself in so much danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The amount of meat he brings back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,won't fill the stomachs\Nof all the animals in the jungle anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,King Panja is definitely\Nwise enough to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He must go even though\Nhe understands the limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had more faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't intend to invite someone\Nso useless all the way from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Janga people are furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion hunting might be a sport to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a matter\Nof life or death to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigs and cattle are their livelihoods…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-But sir--\N-But the white lion steals
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,all of their livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When the villagers\Nwent hunting for the white lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,five or six of them were attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As the wildlife management officer,\NI was consulted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So I called you, a certified hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I had more faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't intend to invite someone\Nso useless all the way from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There he goes again.\NIt's his fifth time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lions that steal livestock are usually\Ncrippled or over the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the management officer,\Nhe seems to be protecting weak animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But livestock are weak animals, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To the animals of the jungle, animals\Non the human's side must be traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ham-and-egg! That lion is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me that the lion\Nhas a female partner, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I said that. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch,\NI'll definitely catch him tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,with this secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The very next day,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the evil humans came again.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be in the forest\Nbattling the humans. That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja! Don't come here! Panja!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come, the humans will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Panja!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliza.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come up with a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The name for\Nour soon-to-be-born son will be Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please name him Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the story of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You must become a son\Nworthy of your father's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You must sneak off\Nof this ship immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and return to Africa, to the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped in this cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave without you, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're behaving\Nlike Panja's son should?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cruel. Leo is still so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.\NThis ship will be sinking soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only animals can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So she's letting her son go before--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hunting for mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible!\NI know, I'll go and help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. If you are brave enough\Nto help them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,why can't you go to Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The jungle is even worse than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in the way.\NCan't you swim any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:18:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For goodness’ sake! Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tuna will teach you, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your tail fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this your tail fin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch closely.\NKeep your body flat like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Firstly, open your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you ride along on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick the water like this, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief. I've never seen a fish\Nwho's as bad at swimming as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up on swimming and travel on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans use these to travel sometimes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! This is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so hopeless,\Nhe's happy just to be pushed along by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A saw shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-You did it!\N-Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was brilliant, little boy.\NAnd you were swimming with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget how you just swam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on your way with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't feel lonely, Leo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy is with you, Leo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy is here{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in the stars now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm watching you from the sky{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm shining my light on you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go on, Leo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never stop, Leo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy's dearest child{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, butterflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.07,0:23:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be near land.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.68,0:24:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Africa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Africa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leo returned to Africa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and headed towards his homeland{\i}\N{\i1}which he had never seen.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.35,0:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He lost his way many times,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.35,0:25:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he felt like giving up many times.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Leo kept walking.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.59,0:25:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What Leo saw{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.13,0:25:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on his way{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.92,0:25:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was a horrifying world{\i}\N{\i1}where animals were killing each other.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.45,0:25:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A few months have now passed{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.16,0:25:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Leo has grown a little bit larger.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.97,0:26:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you hyenas over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you ganging up on Mr. Antelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Mr. Antelope is shivering.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.93,0:26:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.60,0:26:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to stop us? That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better not move, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.98,0:26:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you later\Nafter we finish off that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.82,0:26:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen his face\Naround here before. Have you, Bo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.70,0:26:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't either, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.71,0:26:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we should\Nintroduce ourselves, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess.\N-Right, Bo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.50,0:26:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show him who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.69,0:27:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The very hungry{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyena gang{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.49,0:27:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Dick{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.62,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Bo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Together we are{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.34,0:27:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Dimwit Duo{\i}\N{\i1}-Wrong!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.55,0:27:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Together we are Dick and Bo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the powerful{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.73,0:27:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We bow down{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.90,0:27:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the powerless{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.20,0:27:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are big and strong{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you ready?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.24,0:28:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here we go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.24,0:28:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.58,0:28:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One, two, three{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.29,0:28:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.84,0:28:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Antelope!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.88,0:28:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.43,0:28:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.43,0:28:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone named\NPanja around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja? Panja was certainly here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.67,0:28:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone. Panja Jr. has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.71,0:28:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the clearing in the forest.\NEverybody is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.55,0:28:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Panja Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.46,0:28:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.47,0:29:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how he's completely white\Njust like his father!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.81,0:29:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't brag just because you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.98,0:29:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always thought this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.98,0:29:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To celebrate today's happy occasion,\Nwe decided to have a festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.28,0:29:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.82,0:29:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.66,0:29:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Samson the buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.75,0:29:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just brought offerings\Nfor the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.71,0:29:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you accept them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.06,0:29:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.52,0:29:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Those mules are the offerings\Nfor the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.85,0:29:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.48,0:29:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just kidnapped them from\Nthe Janga village. They're livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:29:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a good time\Nwhile eating these mules.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go first, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.53,0:30:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I should kill and eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.95,0:30:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.37,0:30:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When Panja was here,\Nwe had festivals like these often.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Leo?\NJust have a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to eat our offering, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.05,0:30:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to return them to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.56,0:30:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.02,0:30:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear him, everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the son\Nof the mighty Panja?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo. I'm disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.28,0:30:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a true jungle animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.91,0:30:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.58,0:30:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You barbaric bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.88,0:30:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mandy, we must do something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.25,0:30:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.59,0:31:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the little son does have a spine
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.67,0:31:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,unlike you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.76,0:31:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But Leo might get squashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.59,0:31:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that would be that then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.89,0:31:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You must all calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.39,0:31:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Coco is such a show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.97,0:31:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Samson, I can see why you're upset--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.52,0:31:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.69,0:31:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch, I'll cook him into a steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.86,0:31:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're the one who'll be squashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.95,0:31:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.78,0:31:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. So stop getting in the way\Nand stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.88,0:31:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. I see you do have courage\Nas you should. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.96,0:31:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to eat them, then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.84,0:31:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But in that case,\Nnobody will call you the son of Panja.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.13,0:31:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really okay with you, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.47,0:31:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.39,0:32:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.77,0:32:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.56,0:32:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,To the village of Janga.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.73,0:32:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.15,0:32:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.13,0:33:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.55,0:33:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he be okay? Birds are night-blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.56,0:33:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.89,0:33:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.\NDid you see the lion's skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.91,0:33:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I did. It is hung on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.94,0:34:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.66,0:34:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.33,0:34:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.54,0:34:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.58,0:34:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my father as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.96,0:34:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.63,0:34:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.88,0:34:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.30,0:34:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now now, you are not free to come near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.26,0:34:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, you have
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.93,0:34:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,misplaced my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.27,0:34:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Misplaced?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.27,0:34:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, displaced…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.52,0:34:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it replaced?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.81,0:34:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.02,0:34:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot. I wanted you to say,\N"You have {\i1}disgraced{\i} my name."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.69,0:34:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.15,0:34:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you have {\i1}disgraced{\i} my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.24,0:34:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.66,0:34:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.20,0:34:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-You fool!\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.33,0:35:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only natural for younger generations\Nto try new ways to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.12,0:35:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am actually happy that you erased…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.12,0:35:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean disgraced my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.25,0:35:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Son, you are Panja's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.50,0:35:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Have courage and honor.\NBehave with dignity."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.55,0:35:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.13,0:35:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.18,0:35:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Panja's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.89,0:35:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody in the jungle says\NI'm not your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.22,0:35:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.72,0:35:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a coward.\NYou shouldn't let them say such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.15,0:35:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, they will understand\Nthat you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.69,0:35:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Be confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.79,0:35:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.87,0:35:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm sorry!\N-You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.00,0:35:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you\Nuse my father's skin to play a prank!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.30,0:35:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.93,0:36:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, do we look like we want to harm you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Grampa Mandy, Tommy, Coco,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.69,0:36:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,do you really think I did the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.06,0:36:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.23,0:36:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.90,0:36:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.49,0:36:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, Samson and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.78,0:36:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,will figure out how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.78,0:36:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray for Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.45,0:36:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.91,0:36:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.42,0:36:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wildfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.30,0:36:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A wildfire has broken out in the jungle.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.60,0:36:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wildfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.22,0:36:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.95,0:37:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wildfires are common in the dry season{\i}\N{\i1}when there's a long period of no rain.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.29,0:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, it is always unfortunate{\i}\N{\i1}for those animals who are affected.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.14,0:37:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So much of the savanna is burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.23,0:37:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's good the fire didn't spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.35,0:37:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised and thought\Nhumans might have caused it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.94,0:37:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans have ways\Nto make fields for agriculture
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.57,0:37:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,by burning a part of the jungle\Nto scorch the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.65,0:37:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Maybe we should make\Nour own vegetable fields!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.32,0:37:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our own vegetable fields?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we wouldn't have to\Nkill and eat each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this child insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.00,0:37:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is he--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.67,0:37:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.76,0:37:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.22,0:38:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.34,0:38:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We can never make our own fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.09,0:38:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.34,0:38:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Queen Eliza…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.18,0:38:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.68,0:38:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.10,0:38:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay if you don't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.36,0:38:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup. There it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.25,0:38:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmph…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Laiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making Leo do all the work?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.93,0:38:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourselves males? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.27,0:38:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Laiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.85,0:38:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leo. I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.61,0:39:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll help me,\NI won't need anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.82,0:39:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Drat. Should we just let her\Ninsult us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.57,0:39:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. I'll show her that Zoro is a male.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.45,0:39:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tachi is a male too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.67,0:39:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.92,0:39:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm a male too. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.72,0:39:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.94,0:39:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.32,0:39:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.78,0:39:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We should grow our own vegetables\Nand maybe open a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! That'll be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.34,0:40:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're carving rocks{\i}\N{\i1}Chopping down huge trees{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.68,0:40:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We work up a sweat{\i}\N{\i1}Until we're starving{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.02,0:40:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our four legs standing firm{\i}\N{\i1}Are starting to shake{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.61,0:40:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But none of us are lazy{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.07,0:40:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's do our best{\i}\N{\i1}Making fields out of the jungle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.29,0:40:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's make a nice field for the village{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.22,0:40:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The morning sun rises{\i}\N{\i1}The evening sun sets{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.47,0:40:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We work all night{\i}\N{\i1}We have stopped taking naps{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.94,0:41:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our eyes are starting to get blurry{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.61,0:41:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we can all take it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.82,0:41:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's do our best{\i}\N{\i1}Making fields out of the jungle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.33,0:41:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our restaurant will be completed soon{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.73,0:41:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.90,0:41:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in line to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.33,0:42:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.42,0:42:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an invitation to\Nthe opening of Mandy's Restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.50,0:42:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The restaurant has opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.80,0:42:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should come too, birds.\NSo many delicious items on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.18,0:42:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.84,0:42:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.85,0:42:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an invitation ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.43,0:42:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean,\Nbut I'm so very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.77,0:42:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean if you take this ticket\Nto Mandy's Restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.56,0:42:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you can eat everything for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.28,0:42:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.\NI should head on over right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.45,0:42:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.74,0:42:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a large group of diners.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.17,0:42:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, where's my food?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.88,0:42:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.71,0:42:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered green grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.17,0:42:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered a fruit of banabana.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.71,0:42:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, one green grass,\None fruit of banabana, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.22,0:42:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there! Whew, so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.30,0:42:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have some coconut juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.22,0:42:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tommy. Get me a coconut.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.14,0:43:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't climb trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.47,0:43:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See if there are any on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.53,0:43:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks difficult for Mr. Giraffe to eat\Nbecause of his long neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.45,0:43:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, Leo?\NAre you done eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.95,0:43:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.37,0:43:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was done eating a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.16,0:43:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.21,0:43:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Samson.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.35,0:43:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.06,0:43:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.89,0:43:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What are you saying, Samson?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.35,0:43:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are truly fit to be Panja's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.06,0:43:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody seems to be having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.36,0:43:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be a part of it too.\NThat would be fine, wouldn't it, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.82,0:43:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.83,0:44:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfectly fine, Mr. Samson.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.16,0:44:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, do you want to race?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.83,0:44:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.71,0:44:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.36,0:44:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.90,0:44:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to see the sunset\Nin the desert to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.95,0:44:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since today's work is done,\Nwhy not come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.33,0:44:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.12,0:44:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.25,0:44:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whee!\N-Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.43,0:45:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.77,0:45:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.44,0:45:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,T-The sun broke in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.77,0:45:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's just a whirlwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.41,0:45:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. That was strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.04,0:45:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A sunset and a whirlwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.29,0:45:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a worrisome combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.63,0:45:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.54,0:45:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard the rumors\Nabout the Gods of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.67,0:45:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three of them.\NWhen the sun sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.68,0:45:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,they appear from behind a whirlwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.05,0:45:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they say…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.01,0:45:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beware{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.13,0:46:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beware{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.92,0:46:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The three Gods of Death are coming{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.27,0:46:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beware{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.10,0:46:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sammy the fang cat{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.90,0:46:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dave the giant elephant{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.57,0:46:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Junior the baboon{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.04,0:46:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing left{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.92,0:47:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing left{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.76,0:47:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After they pass through{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.02,0:47:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not even a bone{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.74,0:47:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gods of Death…?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.92,0:47:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.75,0:47:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you the Gods of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.26,0:47:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you called that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.05,0:47:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we the Gods of Death?\NShow him, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.60,0:47:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.27,0:48:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.65,0:48:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo. Don't mess with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.16,0:48:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.01,0:48:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to get it yet, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.94,0:48:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.32,0:48:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.86,0:48:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.57,0:48:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't come to the jungle,\NGods of Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.82,0:48:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can stop us, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.82,0:48:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.04,0:49:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.12,0:49:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.38,0:49:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks like a convenient place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.29,0:49:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good timing. Everybody, bring food.\NDave is outside and he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.77,0:50:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you. The gigantic one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.61,0:50:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NWhy don't you introduce yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.11,0:50:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you're a bit bigger,\Ndoesn't mean you're better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.74,0:50:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Although my body is this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.91,0:50:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loved by everybody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.74,0:50:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.08,0:50:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you use violence, you'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.21,0:50:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.58,0:50:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.84,0:50:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?\NThen bring us more food!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.88,0:50:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Those guys--\N-They're really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.18,0:50:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Leo got clobbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.26,0:50:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.85,0:50:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.22,0:50:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That was nothing. All you have to do is\Nkeep feeding us and we won't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.73,0:50:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there. They need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.65,0:50:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.57,0:50:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This amount won't do at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.53,0:50:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a lot more than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.28,0:50:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.37,0:50:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.91,0:51:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them everything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.62,0:51:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything? We have to ask Grampa Mandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.50,0:51:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what Grampa Mandy says.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.09,0:51:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't make them angry.\NIt's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.00,0:51:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.14,0:51:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.22,0:51:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Dave?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.22,0:51:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've gone far enough\Nthat they won't find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.10,0:52:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down now, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.85,0:52:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.85,0:52:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to fight them!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.86,0:52:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo! You must not!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.90,0:52:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.86,0:52:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down and listen.\NFor a while, until your wounds heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.74,0:52:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,stay right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.62,0:52:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mandy, are you going to\Nlet Leo fight after he heals?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.21,0:52:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.60,0:52:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.44,0:52:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Dave is coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who this Dave is,\Nbut he doesn't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.24,0:53:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink water like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.50,0:53:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whoa!\N-That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.04,0:53:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it! It's not fair!\NI can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.94,0:53:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. They're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.78,0:53:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.95,0:53:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.75,0:53:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them keep doing\Nwhatever they want any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.67,0:53:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Watch me!\N-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.63,0:53:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to see Leo again?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.38,0:53:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm going to train Leo\Nso he can defeat the Gods of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.38,0:53:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show them what I got--
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.67,0:54:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.72,0:54:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lived in the Jungle\Nfor quite a while, Coco the parrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.60,0:54:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much Leo tries,\Nthey are physically undefeatable
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.97,0:54:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.27,0:54:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You scatterbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.40,0:54:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They've turned many jungles
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.73,0:54:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,into graveyards all around Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.07,0:54:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gods of Death are\Nexactly what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they eat up\Nall our grass and all of us too,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.79,0:54:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as they did to other areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.00,0:54:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we should get together and flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.21,0:54:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Coco?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.46,0:54:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Leo's wounds are healed,\Nthat's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.85,0:54:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No. That wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.69,0:54:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the Gods of Death\Nwho roam all around Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.19,0:54:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They know the habits of lions very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.57,0:55:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Once to the left\Nand once to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.19,0:55:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck to avoid the tusks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.03,0:55:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your tail to hit their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.78,0:55:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, bite his sore spot, the nose…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.99,0:55:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.75,0:55:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the target here, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.46,0:55:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.09,0:55:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.10,0:55:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.48,0:55:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You could do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.58,0:55:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If your heart's not in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.37,0:55:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then maybe you should give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.87,0:55:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to abandon the jungle\Nand flee like Grandpa Mandy says?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.88,0:56:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Leo, be strong.\NBecome stronger. I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.93,0:56:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it, Coco.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.60,0:56:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's too hard for me.\N-Don't cry, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.60,0:56:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one forcing you\Nto do something impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.67,0:56:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The grass we're growing is running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.93,0:56:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Coco, where's Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.14,0:56:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The jungle is being vandalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.81,0:57:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he has things to do and…\NIf you would excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.15,0:57:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Coco.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.23,0:57:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Coco.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.99,0:57:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.49,0:57:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be hiding Leo. Didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.85,0:57:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Father.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.56,0:57:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm at the point of giving up.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.65,0:57:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though{\i}\N{\i1}the most important battle is near…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.53,0:57:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.70,0:57:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please answer me, Father{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.22,0:58:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please give me strength, Father{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.27,0:58:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wonderful strength{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.15,0:58:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like your mane{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.78,0:58:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My father who was strong{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.46,0:58:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm trying to be coddled.{\i}\N{\i1}How embarrassing.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.09,0:59:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't help it because his body is warm{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.10,0:59:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.65,0:59:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I'm wrapped in my father's fur,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.12,0:59:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel something flowing into my body.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.04,0:59:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.75,0:59:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.92,0:59:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is strength, right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.79,1:00:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.55,1:00:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.55,1:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.06,1:00:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.52,1:00:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.35,1:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.53,1:00:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't put it off any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.41,1:00:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.\NI'll repeat it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.37,1:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They must never find us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.04,1:00:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to do that,\Nwe'll flee in small numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.00,1:00:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means, do not panic.\NDo not make loud noises.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.38,1:00:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.56,1:01:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.56,1:01:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.27,1:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.69,1:01:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it.\NThe essential animals are all gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.95,1:02:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This jungle is completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.41,1:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed up, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.16,1:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.95,1:02:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Dave!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.79,1:02:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be angry at us, Dave.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.42,1:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's something left\Nthat we can eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.09,1:02:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.88,1:02:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here, you three.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.63,1:02:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job bringing us food.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.10,1:02:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.98,1:02:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-You won't feel a thing while I eat you.\N-Stay away from us!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.77,1:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.78,1:02:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? I heard children screaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.83,1:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's difficult for me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.41,1:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Being chosen by the Gods of Death\Nwas our bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.25,1:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move to another jungle
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.34,1:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and start over from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.84,1:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Never! I don't want to!\NI don't want to flee from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.43,1:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Leo. It must have been\Na shocking experience for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.85,1:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so,\Nwe can't let him act out like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.81,1:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.60,1:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.60,1:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you throw\Nmy father's fur, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.02,1:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.53,1:03:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You stubborn child!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.36,1:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mean, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.11,1:03:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.24,1:03:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The trio has been eaten!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.53,1:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And Coco was…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.58,1:03:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coco was captured!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.16,1:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to rescue him quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.96,1:03:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You cannot go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.17,1:03:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.67,1:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get caught up in this,\Nwe might lose all the animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.05,1:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We should move everybody to safety first.\NLeo, please leave the jungle with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.39,1:03:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, you're being kind of cruel.\NWhat will happen to Coco?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.60,1:03:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go rescue Coco.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.56,1:03:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry, it might be too late…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.39,1:03:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.48,1:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo! Are you going to disobey\Nwhat this elder says?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.94,1:04:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.53,1:04:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want another chance\Nto try out my strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.90,1:04:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.87,1:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those three were good animals.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.91,1:04:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coco is too.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can stop me, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.92,1:04:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well well.\NYou two are definitely father and son.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.63,1:04:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're behaving in the same exact way\NKing Panja did on that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.42,1:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.76,1:04:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last day\NI saw your father alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.72,1:04:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That morning, that day…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.52,1:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop your father from going.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.78,1:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous! If you go now,\Nyou will surely be trapped by humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. But still, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.99,1:04:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.20,1:04:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to disobey\Nwhat this elder says?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.62,1:05:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.92,1:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fighting those\Nwho bring calamity to this jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.38,1:05:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.34,1:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliza was captured by those humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.47,1:05:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She is waiting for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.64,1:05:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if this is to be my last day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.44,1:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you live happily with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.98,1:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With those last words,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.94,1:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King Panja ran{\i}\N{\i1}straight towards your mother{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.36,1:05:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who was trapped in a cage.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.79,1:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go, Leo.{\i}\N{\i1}I won't stop you anymore.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.09,1:05:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best to fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.93,1:05:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.24,1:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His mane shining{\i}\N{\i1}Thunder rolling{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.04,1:06:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He pierces through the storm{\i}\N{\i1}Leo the white lion{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.00,1:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Taking on a challenge{\i}\N{\i1}His dream for happiness{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.26,1:06:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He brings the morning{\i}\N{\i1}To the jungle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.27,1:06:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On the infinite road{\i}\N{\i1}Leo advances{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.90,1:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His mane flows{\i}\N{\i1}The vast savanna{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.66,1:07:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chest held out in the wilderness{\i}\N{\i1}Leo the white lion{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.92,1:07:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His good friends{\i}\N{\i1}are ringing a bell{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.21,1:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song he sings{\i}\N{\i1}Bounces through the jungle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.93,1:07:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Steady on the road{\i}\N{\i1}Leo advances{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.07,1:07:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying\Nyou don't know where everybody went?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.41,1:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.96,1:07:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.00,1:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's each eat half of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.21,1:07:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Drat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.96,1:07:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.96,1:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.03,1:08:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.03,1:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he would come to save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.83,1:08:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.89,1:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The all-white little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.47,1:08:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.74,1:08:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've improved, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.38,1:09:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo. We're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.07,1:09:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He went around to the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.29,1:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?\NShow yourself, white one!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.63,1:09:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.80,1:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dave, he's on top of that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.17,1:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.80,1:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.18,1:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.93,1:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.85,1:10:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mandy, why didn't you flee?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.64,1:10:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave you and run.\NThat's heartless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.77,1:10:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.07,1:10:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How is your wound?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.74,1:11:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that. It tickles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.00,1:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.75,1:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.42,1:11:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, strong little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.81,1:11:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, I hope you keep protecting us
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.44,1:11:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,like your father King Panja used to.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.53,1:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please protect us, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.15,1:11:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-We want you to.\N-Please do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.70,1:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.70,1:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.74,1:11:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back, I think we were too weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.04,1:11:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleeing is not the only smart choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.95,1:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you put your mind to it,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.37,1:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,a little boy like Leo can succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.00,1:11:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,let's combine our efforts
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.67,1:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and confront our enemies together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.88,1:12:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.80,1:12:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we should go home.\NThere's work to do in the fields tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.05,1:12:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.74,1:12:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,His body is small, but in essence,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.79,1:12:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he's the mighty emperor of the jungle.\NIsn't he, Coco?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.75,1:12:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish King Panja and Queen Eliza
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.13,1:12:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,were here to…
